index a096fdeaa7887dacb1a4d37aa15f76c4236763e6..fadfbd7cf1bdd0b792c5d7f25a113325d1b779bc 100644
--- a/docs/cli.rst
+++ b/docs/cli.rst
@@ -712,6 +712,15 @@ You can delete all the existing rows in the table before inserting the new recor
 
     $ sqlite-utils insert dogs.db dogs dogs.json --truncate
 
+You can extract repeated values into a separate lookup table using
+``--extract COLUMN``::
+
+    $ sqlite-utils insert trees.db trees trees.json --extract species
+
+The ``species`` values in the inserted rows will be replaced by integer foreign
+keys to a new ``species`` table. Use ``--extract`` more than once to extract
+multiple columns.
+
 .. _cli_inserting_data_binary:
 
 Inserting binary data
